msgstr "Κλειδί API AbuseIPDB."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-option.php:1049
msgid "Get an API key"
msgstr "Λήψη κλειδιού API"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-option.php:1057
msgid "Enable On All Forms"
msgstr "Ενεργοποίηση σε όλες τις φόρμες"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-option.php:1059
msgid ""
"If checked, AbuseIPDB checks run on every form. Otherwise enable it per form "
